<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
	<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
	<title>{{ settings.ai_chat_title | default: 'Chatbot Pharma Cosmetics' | escape }}</title>
	{%- if settings.theme_favicon_enable -%}
	<link rel="icon" href="{{ 'favicon.png' | asset_url }}" type="image/x-icon">
	{%- endif -%}
	{%- comment -%}
	  21/11/2026 (chủ dự án): layout riêng cho trang chat nhúng iframe (templates/page.chat.bwt) — KHÔNG header/footer/popup/nút liên hệ.
	  Chỉ nạp token màu (màu theo Cấu hình theme › Màu sắc) + pc-ui.css (Tailwind dựng sẵn) + font Montserrat qua pc-ui.css.
	{%- endcomment -%}
	{% include 'design_tokens' %}
	{{ content_for_header }}
	{{ 'pc-ui.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
</head>
<body class="m-0 bg-white font-sans text-ink">
	{{ content_for_layout }}
</body>
</html>
